AUDIO: 'Very, very simple prompt. And I actually would like to give you guys a little pro tip here. Um if you spell everything out the way you would sound it, so phonetically, you actually are able to avoid a lot of the pitfalls of speech when it comes to understanding the text'

[05:22] [scene:ui]
VISUAL: ComfyUI workflow, showing the generated video output.
AUDIO: 'from the model. A lot of models don\'t understand how to say things like H3, like with the dash, it can mess it up. So, I tend to do things like GGUFs for GGUF and that phonetic spelling tends to'

